          "end": 147.722,
          "en": "Now, the important thing to note",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 147.722,
          "end": 152.451,
          "en": "is that Typescript code does not run in the browser though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 152.451,
          "end": 155.82,
          "en": "so if you try to execute type script in the browser,",
          "zh": ""
        },
